Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:08.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So then, have you made up\Nyour mind to take the exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:09.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.89,0:00:11.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can even wag my tail too if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:14.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:19.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From now on, you two will apply yourself to \Nyour studies wherever you feel is most suitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.49,0:00:22.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"The Sewing Life Alchemist"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.03,0:00:24.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shou Tucker—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.45,0:00:27.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the foremost authority on transmuting living bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:35.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And so, we came to spend the remaining time before our exam at the Tucker house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:40.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.59,0:00:45.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.89,0:00:50.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:56.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:48.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two years ago,\NMr. Tucker successfully transmuted\Na Chimera that could speak man's language.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.80,0:02:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He has taken the State Alchemist Certification Examination as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.93,0:02:53.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Chimera that speaks man's language?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.35,0:02:58.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was a composite beast that was created at the cost of multiple creatures that had differing genetics.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.23,0:03:03.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or, to put it another way, a Chimera that could understand what a person says and could speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.36,0:03:04.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.11,0:03:09.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tucker also lives with his daughter, who is about to turn four.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.41,0:03:12.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then he doesn't have a wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:14.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:20.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:21.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible, huh, Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.29,0:03:26.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?\NCome over here, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.38,0:03:27.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:38.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,B-Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:41.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't do that, you know, Alexander!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.14,0:03:42.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.81,0:03:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're Tucker-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.32,0:03:50.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm terribly sorry about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.07,0:03:52.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have any woman's touch around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:55.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like this inside the house too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.83,0:04:02.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow. Bigger Brother's clothes are funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.92,0:04:04.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't they heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.21,0:04:06.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:08.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brother is very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.84,0:04:18.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll have a chance to \Ndiscuss their natures at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.22,0:04:20.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Until you do, just accept them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.64,0:04:25.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, Nina, go play outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.44,0:04:29.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alexander must be lonesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:33.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:42.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought you'd aspire to be State Alchemists at your ages?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:47.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If there's anything I can do for you,\Njust let me know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:51.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Tucker-san, I'd like to have you\Nshow us the Chimera you transmuted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.88,0:04:53.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.30,0:04:59.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, it died not long after \Nit was transmuted, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:03.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anyways, passing marks come first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.56,0:05:06.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It will take more than just an\Novernight effort to pass this test.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.24,0:05:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the materials room. You're free to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.53,0:05:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is incredible, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:18.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's full of books I've never even seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.53,0:05:21.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The materials in here are just a fraction
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.41,0:05:24.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,compared to what they have\Nat the National Central Library.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:27.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you pass the test, you can get\Nmaterials that will give you dozens—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.71,0:05:31.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,no, hundreds of times\Nmore knowledge than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.17,0:05:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.38,0:05:34.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, we should get busy—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:40.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.39,0:05:46.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed-kun, are you making any progress with your studies?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.31,0:05:48.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, some.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.77,0:05:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there's so much stuff here that I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.77,0:05:55.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The test is hard even for adults who have received special education.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.78,0:05:58.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you're still so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.66,0:06:00.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to force yourself to\Nworry about it this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:02.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:04.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll try to do everything that I can,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:07.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,no matter how slim the\Npossibilities are of me passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:10.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I can keep moving ahead...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.17,0:06:16.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bigger Brother, \Nyou haven't eaten anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:18.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That won't do! You have to make sure to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.22,0:06:21.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.35,0:06:24.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:26.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This sure does look delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.98,0:06:28.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be sure you chew it well!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.02,0:06:30.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.44,0:06:31.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This sure is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.40,0:06:34.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here! Have another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.36,0:06:39.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:42.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. My head is too full of all the things I learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.45,0:06:44.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:46.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.87,0:06:50.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll be able\Nto pass the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.17,0:06:53.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you should at least get a good night's rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.51,0:06:58.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It sure takes me back, the way this all feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.01,0:07:04.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The two of us wanted nothing\Nbut to become State Alchemists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.68,0:07:09.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once we did, we felt that some kind of path would become open to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:18.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no, is it this late already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.86,0:07:21.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:26.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he off playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.29,0:07:29.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.33,0:07:31.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.87,0:07:34.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Little Big Brother, it snowed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:54.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.23,0:07:59.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish you could stay here all the time\Nafter you pass your test.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.87,0:08:08.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brother, what are you drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.74,0:08:12.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's called a transmutation circle.\NIt's an incantation to get a wish granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:14.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.46,0:08:15.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.05,0:08:24.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.93,0:08:26.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brother,\Nthat was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:28.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:30.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Major Hughes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.06,0:08:33.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey there! I've come to pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.64,0:08:35.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's your birthday today, right, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:37.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:40.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How would you know\Nsomething like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.61,0:08:43.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}am{\i0} with the research department, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.20,0:08:45.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go to my house. My wife is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.33,0:08:49.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You too there, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.83,0:08:52.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A celebration is more fun\Nif you share it with everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.21,0:08:58.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on in!\NThank you all for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.13,0:09:00.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my wife, Gracia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.01,0:09:02.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your stomach's so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.17,0:09:03.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:05.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to have a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.38,0:09:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very shortly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:10.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a big fuss inside my tummy saying "I want to come out soon!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:11.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.93,0:09:12.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you want to feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.98,0:09:14.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:15.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina wants to feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.27,0:09:17.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, Nina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.65,0:09:21.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:24.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible! Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:38.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay then, does anyone want refills on their tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:40.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.55,0:09:43.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gracia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:46.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Honey, {\i1}uma{\i0}—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.26,0:09:47.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Uma{\i0}? [horse]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:48.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Umareru{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.18,0:09:49.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,[the baby's coming]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.35,0:09:51.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It can't be...!\NThe due date isn't here yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.89,0:09:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, the baby wants to come out already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.68,0:09:56.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A doctor!\NWe have to get to a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.15,0:09:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-There's a blizzard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'll bring a doctor here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.99,0:10:05.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sit tight, Gracia!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:06.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,J-Just a sec—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:10.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.62,0:10:13.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gracia-san, I brought some hot water!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:16.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\NSet it there on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:18.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:21.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let' see... I suppose\Nwe'll need a lot of towels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:23.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Towels, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:24.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.22,0:10:36.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The doctor sure is taking a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.39,0:10:39.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, with all this snow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:42.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't take any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.61,0:10:43.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.94,0:10:46.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! Gracia-san said she's going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.78,0:10:47.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sh-She couldn't be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mama-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.38,0:10:54.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's not dead, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:56.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You idiot! She's just lost consciousness, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.25,0:10:58.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if you think about it like alchemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:11:01.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there's a considerable cost in creating a new life!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:03.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Childbirth isn't alchemy, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:08.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-Thank goodness she's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:09.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Gracia-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:16.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit, what should we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:18.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can there be nothing\Nwe can do at a time like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.73,0:11:20.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.48,0:11:21.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the water is cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.31,0:11:24.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.44,0:11:30.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother! What did you just do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.53,0:11:31.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:34.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing? But where's the transmutation circle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.70,0:11:37.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then how did the water get hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.87,0:11:39.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How would I know?!\NMust've been force of mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.41,0:11:43.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.34,0:11:48.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.55,0:11:52.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Isn't the doctor here yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:04.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Outstanding! Outstanding, Gracia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.53,0:12:09.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.28,0:12:12.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.53,0:12:16.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-We didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.33,0:12:18.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:21.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You stayed at my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.01,0:12:38.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This alchemy stuff—turns out it wasn't any help at all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.51,0:12:41.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In contrast, mothers are\Nsomething awesome, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.89,0:12:46.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can do something an alchemist wouldn't be able to do in a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.40,0:12:49.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The same goes for our mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.94,0:12:52.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.66,0:13:00.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I was that warm and soft when I was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.20,0:13:03.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O-Of course you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.62,0:13:05.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.59,0:13:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After that, we became\Nmuch more absorbed in alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.52,0:13:26.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was all we could do, wishing to take back the bodies we were born with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.90,0:13:33.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.49,0:13:36.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you heated that water before without using a transmutation circle, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:41.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That situation was something out of the ordinary, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.29,0:13:45.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even so, it was still\Nincredible of you, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:46.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll have to keep at it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.79,0:13:49.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Well then, I'll quiz you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.17,0:13:54.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The test was drawing ever nearer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:05.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Every year, the test is held in the order of written exam, then interview, and then practical skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.39,0:14:05.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't say anything about\Nhow many people will be taking it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:09.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but each year, there are only one or two people who pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.86,0:14:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean, that's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.03,0:14:16.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, what kind of things do they do during the interview?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:19.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In my case, all they did was a question-and-answer session,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I understand that there are also physical examinations, depending on the person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.33,0:14:25.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A physical examination, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.79,0:14:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And another thing...\NAt the practical skills test,\Nabout half the people brought the results of their research, like I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:36.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and about half showed off\Ntheir transmuting on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.92,0:14:39.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you guys going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.89,0:14:45.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm at a loss. What are we going\Nto do for the practical skills test?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.85,0:14:49.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if they do a physical exam before then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.19,0:14:51.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll find out that the inside of this armor is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.23,0:14:57.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm sure that Lt. Col. Mustang is thinking up something for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.49,0:14:59.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I sure hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.95,0:15:05.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As we embraced our uneasiness, the day of the test finally came.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.43,0:15:23.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We will now begin the\Npreliminary examination.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:25.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.65,0:15:41.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brothers! How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.45,0:15:45.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't make it to the last question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.33,0:15:48.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I got through all of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.83,0:15:50.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but next comes the interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:57.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never would've expected the younger brother to pass the written too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.46,0:15:59.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.97,0:16:04.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The interview...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:11.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't mean it!\NI can't accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.69,0:16:15.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why? Why would you tell me\Nnot to go through the interview?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.48,0:16:18.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you wish to go any further\Nwhile still concealing your past,\Nthat's the only thing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.94,0:16:21.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I want to stay together with my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.49,0:16:23.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:26.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like Old Lady Pinako said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.53,0:16:30.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,State Alchemists get rounded up\Nwhenever war breaks out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.33,0:16:35.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they have to use\Ntheir alchemy to harm others\Nfor the good of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:38.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Passing equals "dog of the military."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.17,0:16:40.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But still!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.21,0:16:44.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll be enough for me alone\Nto become a State Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.39,0:16:48.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure I become one and grant you your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:53.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.12,0:17:15.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A golden three-legged stool?\NWhy doesn't it fall over like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:16.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.75,0:17:21.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you are a true alchemist,\Nthe chair will not refuse you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:25.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemist, at no time\Nallow yourself to be afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.60,0:17:34.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.02,0:17:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So then, let's hear your\Nmotivations for taking the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.23,0:17:41.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's because...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.37,0:17:54.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I made a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.83,0:17:57.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told the only other\Nmember of my family
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.33,0:17:59.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that I would make sure\NI became a State Alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.68,0:18:07.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.39,0:18:11.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We chose the right path, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.43,0:18:13.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.27,0:18:17.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the one thing\NI am sure about...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.81,0:18:20.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is that I want to touch you once again, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.90,0:18:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's strange, huh?\NHere we are, always so near each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:31.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I can't even remember\Nwhat it feels like to touch you,\Nor the warmth of your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:38.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then, the morning\Nof the practical skills test...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.42,0:18:40.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.50,0:18:42.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.38,0:18:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.01,0:18:50.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big Brother, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.18,0:18:59.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an incantation\Nto grant your wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.73,0:19:02.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Nina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:21.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We now offer you all of the matter that exists within these premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.96,0:19:27.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please make use of it to\Ntransmute whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.80,0:19:29.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever I like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.01,0:19:32.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What on earth should I do in order to pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.61,0:19:51.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is a magnificent article,\Nbut the fact that he's used up all of his strength is, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.41,0:19:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is he serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.16,0:19:55.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go next.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.83,0:20:01.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Trees and water?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.63,0:20:08.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope Big Brother is all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:11.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He has your incantation, Nina, so he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:20.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nicely done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.02,0:20:24.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He made paper and hydrogen\Nout of the wood and water, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.78,0:20:33.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:16.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So he can do it without a transmutation circle...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.16,0:21:22.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An underage alchemist, huh?\NIntriguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.13,0:21:32.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow! How amazingly beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.24,0:21:54.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.99,0:21:58.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to stop all my wavering!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.24,0:22:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to just look straight ahead\Nand race forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.37,0:22:04.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I dead-end, I'll cross that bridge when I come to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.67,0:22:11.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someday, no matter what,\NI'm going to return you\Nback to the way you were!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.55,0:22:17.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you do, Brother,\N{\i1}your{\i0} body will be there with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.26,0:23:42.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.30,0:23:45.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 7: "Night of the Chimera's Cry"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.97,0:23:49.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nina...
